       >>SOURCE FORMAT FREE
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. TXNBATCH.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
FILE-CONTROL.
    SELECT TXN-FILE ASSIGN TO TXNIN
        ORGANIZATION IS SEQUENTIAL
        FILE STATUS IS WS-TXN-STATUS.
    SELECT AUDIT-FILE ASSIGN TO TXNOUT
        ORGANIZATION IS SEQUENTIAL
        FILE STATUS IS WS-AUDIT-STATUS.
DATA DIVISION.
FILE SECTION.
FD TXN-FILE RECORD CONTAINS 80 CHARACTERS.
01 TXN-INPUT-RECORD.
    COPY TXNREC.
FD AUDIT-FILE RECORD CONTAINS 80 CHARACTERS.
01 AUDIT-RECORD.
   05 AUDIT-RECORD-TYPE            PIC X.
   05 AUDIT-ACCOUNT-ID             PIC X(10).
   05 AUDIT-STATUS                 PIC X(8).
   05 AUDIT-AMOUNT                 PIC +9(7).99.
   05 AUDIT-BALANCE                PIC +9(7).99.
   05 FILLER                       PIC X(39).
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-TXN-STATUS                   PIC XX.
01 WS-AUDIT-STATUS                 PIC XX.
01 WS-EOF                          PIC X VALUE 'N'.
01 WS-OPENING-FOUND                PIC X VALUE 'N'.
01 WS-ACCOUNT-ID                   PIC X(10) VALUE SPACES.
01 WS-BALANCE                      PIC S9(7)V99 COMP-3 VALUE ZERO.
01 WS-CREDIT-TOTAL                 PIC S9(7)V99 COMP-3 VALUE ZERO.
01 WS-DEBIT-TOTAL                  PIC S9(7)V99 COMP-3 VALUE ZERO.
01 WS-ACCEPTED-COUNT               PIC 9(5) VALUE ZERO.
01 WS-REJECTED-COUNT               PIC 9(5) VALUE ZERO.
01 WS-OUTCOME                      PIC X(8) VALUE SPACES.
01 WS-EDITED-BALANCE               PIC +9(7).99.
01 WS-EDITED-CREDIT                PIC +9(7).99.
01 WS-EDITED-DEBIT                 PIC +9(7).99.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN.
    OPEN INPUT TXN-FILE
         OUTPUT AUDIT-FILE
    IF WS-TXN-STATUS NOT = '00' OR WS-AUDIT-STATUS NOT = '00'
        DISPLAY 'OPEN-ERROR|' WS-TXN-STATUS '|' WS-AUDIT-STATUS
        MOVE 12 TO RETURN-CODE
        GOBACK
    END-IF

    PERFORM UNTIL WS-EOF = 'Y'
        READ TXN-FILE
            AT END
                MOVE 'Y' TO WS-EOF
            NOT AT END
                PERFORM PROCESS-RECORD
                PERFORM WRITE-AUDIT
        END-READ
    END-PERFORM

    MOVE WS-BALANCE TO WS-EDITED-BALANCE
    MOVE WS-CREDIT-TOTAL TO WS-EDITED-CREDIT
    MOVE WS-DEBIT-TOTAL TO WS-EDITED-DEBIT
    DISPLAY 'SUMMARY|ACCEPTED=' WS-ACCEPTED-COUNT
        '|REJECTED=' WS-REJECTED-COUNT
        '|CREDITS=' WS-EDITED-CREDIT
        '|DEBITS=' WS-EDITED-DEBIT
        '|BALANCE=' WS-EDITED-BALANCE
    CLOSE TXN-FILE AUDIT-FILE
    GOBACK.

PROCESS-RECORD.
    MOVE 'REJECT' TO WS-OUTCOME
    EVALUATE TXN-RECORD-TYPE
        WHEN 'B'
            IF WS-OPENING-FOUND = 'N' AND TXN-AMOUNT >= ZERO
                MOVE 'Y' TO WS-OPENING-FOUND
                MOVE TXN-ACCOUNT-ID TO WS-ACCOUNT-ID
                MOVE TXN-AMOUNT TO WS-BALANCE
                MOVE 'OPENING' TO WS-OUTCOME
            ELSE
                ADD 1 TO WS-REJECTED-COUNT
            END-IF
        WHEN 'C'
            PERFORM PROCESS-CREDIT
        WHEN 'D'
            PERFORM PROCESS-DEBIT
        WHEN OTHER
            CONTINUE
    END-EVALUATE.

PROCESS-CREDIT.
    IF WS-OPENING-FOUND = 'Y'
       AND TXN-ACCOUNT-ID = WS-ACCOUNT-ID
       AND TXN-AMOUNT > ZERO
        ADD TXN-AMOUNT TO WS-BALANCE WS-CREDIT-TOTAL
        ADD 1 TO WS-ACCEPTED-COUNT
        MOVE 'ACCEPT' TO WS-OUTCOME
    ELSE
        ADD 1 TO WS-REJECTED-COUNT
    END-IF.

PROCESS-DEBIT.
    IF WS-OPENING-FOUND = 'Y'
       AND TXN-ACCOUNT-ID = WS-ACCOUNT-ID
       AND TXN-AMOUNT > ZERO
       AND TXN-AMOUNT <= WS-BALANCE
        SUBTRACT TXN-AMOUNT FROM WS-BALANCE
        ADD TXN-AMOUNT TO WS-DEBIT-TOTAL
        ADD 1 TO WS-ACCEPTED-COUNT
        MOVE 'ACCEPT' TO WS-OUTCOME
    ELSE
        ADD 1 TO WS-REJECTED-COUNT
    END-IF.

WRITE-AUDIT.
    MOVE SPACES TO AUDIT-RECORD
    MOVE TXN-RECORD-TYPE TO AUDIT-RECORD-TYPE
    MOVE TXN-ACCOUNT-ID TO AUDIT-ACCOUNT-ID
    MOVE WS-OUTCOME TO AUDIT-STATUS
    MOVE TXN-AMOUNT TO AUDIT-AMOUNT
    MOVE WS-BALANCE TO AUDIT-BALANCE
    WRITE AUDIT-RECORD
    IF WS-AUDIT-STATUS NOT = '00'
        DISPLAY 'WRITE-ERROR|' WS-AUDIT-STATUS
        MOVE 12 TO RETURN-CODE
    END-IF.